<Base title="StrapSheets terms" description="Terms for the StrapSheets app, including subscription renewal.">
  <h1>Terms</h1>
  <p>StrapSheets is a measurement aid. You check the card before you send it. The publisher is not responsible for a measurement you did not check, or for a job decision made from a card.</p>
  <h2>Pro subscription</h2>
  <p>Pro is offered as StrapSheets Pro Monthly and StrapSheets Pro Yearly. The length and the price are the ones shown on the paywall at the time you subscribe. Payment is charged to your Apple ID or Google Play account.</p>
  <p>The subscription renews automatically unless you turn off renewal at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account is charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the period. You manage or cancel the subscription in your App Store or Google Play account settings. Deleting the app does not cancel it. Any unused portion of a free trial, if one is offered, is forfeited when you buy a subscription.</p>
  <p>Restore Purchases puts Pro back on a phone that uses the same store account.</p>
  <h2>The rest</h2>
  <p>The twelve standard tools are free. Custom tools and thread names you add require Pro. The privacy policy is at <a href="/privacy">/privacy</a>. These terms are governed by the laws that apply where you live, and the store's own terms apply to the purchase.</p>
</Base>
